window.products.push({"id":893088,"name":"EGGFECTO Egg Topper - Hard and Soft Boiled Egg Cutter | Mess-Free Egg Opener for Small, Medium, and Large Eggs | Food-Grade Stainless Steel Egg Shell ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SWeUryhsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BOILED EGG SHELL REMOVER FOR CLEAN, PERFECTLY CRACKED EGGS - The EggFecto egg shell opener topper cutter is the perfect egg tool for serving hard or soft boiled eggs. This innovative boiled eggs holder and topper works with gravity to remove the top of an egg neatly and mess-free, with no shell residue. EASY TO CLEAN EGG CUTTER FOR SOFT BOILED EGGS - Gone are the days where you have to strain your arms trying to remove dried egg yolk or egg white residue. All it takes to clean the EggFecto egg cracker for soft boiled eggs is a bit of hot, soapy water, and a quick scrub! QUICK AND EASY EGG DECAPPER - No longer do you have to burn your fingers trying to cut the top off an egg, just use our clever egg opener topper cutter! The cracker cutter is simple to use and works in an instant. EGG CRACKER SEPARATOR CRACKS OPEN EGGS OF ALL SIZES - EggFecto egg toppers are perfect for any sized egg you need cracked. Work with small, medium, large, and extra large shaped eggs and stay clean in the kitchen with this amazing egg topper for soft boiled eggs. EGG SHELL REMOVERS FOR RAW AND HARDBOILED EGGS - The egg topper eggshell cutter is made to crack every type of egg, from raw and soft boiled to hard boiled! A perfect boiled egg cutter for easier breakfast and meal prep. EGG SHELL CUTTER FOR MESS-FREE BOILED EGGS - To use our eggshell cracker, put your egg in the eggshell cup and place the clacker dome on top. Pull the bird upwards towards the handle. Release to drop the egg breaker tool. Repeat the process if necessary. Once you hear an egg clack, remove the shell! EGG CLACKER FOR PRECISE SCORING - The egg crackers sharp stainless steel blade helps to cut the top off any egg swiftly and accurately. The result is a perfectly cut, smooth rounded top without any eggshell residue. EGG CRACKER TOOL SUITABLE FOR ALL FOOD SETTINGS - Thanks to the soft boiled egg topper's food-grade design, you can use it in both household and commercial settings, making it perfect for chefs and home cooks. An egg shell cracker for every kitchen! SHELL SEPARATOR MADE FROM HIGH-QUALITY STAINLESS STEEL - Made from high-quality stainless steel, our boiled egg opener provides a long service life with superior performance in the kitchen. Highly durable and easy to clean for everyday convenience. MAKES THE PERFECT KITCHEN ACCESSORY - With our egg topper cutter, you can make a variety of different breakfast cuisines without needing to worry about broken eggshell bits getting in your meal. One of the best egg gadgets for home cooks and professional chefs!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SWeUryhsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EGGFECTO","source_asin":"B09CDMXKKG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-893088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CDMXKKG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CDMXKKG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
