window.products.push({"id":893135,"name":"Stainless Steel Potato Ricer with Ultra Sharp Multi-Function Vegetable Peeler, Potato Stainless Steel Grinder for Mashed Potatoes, Fruits and More- 3 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814dMJDfg2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you Love the mashed potatoes served at restaurants? Now you can make them at home as well. For smooth and fluffy mashed potatoes, a perfect potato ricer is the best tool. This kitchen gadget gently breaks the potatoes into tiny flaky pieces, creating a uniform texture, light fluffy perfect potatoes. How to use a potato masher to make creamy potatoes? ✔ Peel several potatoes or any veggies and cut them into equally sized pieces. Cook the items in boiling water for about 15 minutes or until they are soft enough to break up if pressed with a fork. ✔ Fit the ricer potato masher with the desired disk, put the inner cylinder on it, and fill the hopper with a few chunks of potatoes. ✔ Hold the potato ricer over the cooking pot, squeeze the handles of the ricer together until the potato puree begins extruding through the holes into the waiting pot. Potato Ricer Features » Stainless Steel Potato Ricer/ Masher » Includes 3 Interchangeable Discs for Fine, Medium, and Coarse sized grains » Ergonomic Super Comfort Handle » Easy and Convenient Manual Mechanism » Works with Many Root Vegetables and many more » Great for Making Gnocchi, Baby Food, and Other Delectable Dishes and Fruits » Dishwasher Safe and easy to clean The Perfect Restaurant and Home Ricing Tool: Making restaurant-quality meals in the comfort of your own home has never been easier with A&K. Our stainless steel potato ricer with bonus potato peeler is the best device to have in your kitchen so you can create top-tier dishes with absolute ease! First you will choose the size of your “rice” and get the corresponding disc. Then second, get your potato, fruit, or any vegetable you want to mash up. Easily press down the handles, and voila! The ergonomic potato ricer handles are designed to reduce any stress that may cause your hands or wrists for a flawless and easy ricing process every time Click Add to Cart button","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814dMJDfg2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"M&G","source_asin":"B08C6KCPVK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-893135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C6KCPVK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C6KCPVK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
