window.products.push({"id":893179,"name":"encoreco – Clear Coffee Mug, Double Wall Glass Tumbler, Glass Coffee Cups with Lids 16 oz Reusable, Travel Coffee Cup/Coffee Glass with Lid, Best for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pguJvtE0L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"The ENCORECO reusable coffee cup is ideal for your preferred drink. Having a lid and double wall insulated cup keeps your drinks colder/warmer than most regular glasses/cups/mugs without a lid (about 30 minutes). This glass coffee cup comes with a comfortable easy grip silicone thermal sleeve and removeable silicone base for added protection. It comes packaged in premium cylinder packaging.THIS SIGNATURE PRODUCT IS FOR YOU IF …★ You crave an aesthetic coffee glass that is uniquely stylish and as distinct as your own personality★ You take delight that the glass sip lid (substantially larger than other models) and non metal coffee travel mug lets you savor your favorite drink without compromising on taste★ You love our planet and value an eco-friendly product★ You secretly fancy the enviable attention that comes with this product when those around you do a double-take of you and your ENCORECO tumbler★ You are looking for a practical and stylish gift for a friend, family member, office mate, boss or business clientCARE AND INSTRUCTIONS:- Handle with care. Glass is fragile.- Dishwasher safe (on top shelf).- Avoid the use of abrasives, bleach or other harsh chemicals when cleaning.- Exercise caution when pouring hot liquids into tumbler.- Avoid extreme temperature changes (hot to cold/cold to hot).- Avoid dropping ice cubes into cup directly from dispenser.- Not suitable for microwave use.*NOTES: (1) Small hole (bottom of glass) is a vent hole that exhausts gas during blowing process to prevent deformation. After production is completed the hole is sealed with a clear sealant. (2) Vacuum seal on lid may be tight upon 1st time removing lid. Soak in warm water & gently pull a part. (3) Your glass is handblown and may have unique curves to appreciate.ENCORECO=encore (means again in French) + eco (environmentally friendly). Get yours today!Replacement lids available for purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pguJvtE0L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"encoreco","source_asin":"B0872J2VL3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-893179","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0872J2VL3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0872J2VL3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
