window.products.push({"id":893217,"name":"BRIGHT ZEAL 13\" Large LED STAR Marquee Sign (MIRROR IMBEDDED, 6hr Timer) - Light Up Sign Wall Decor - Home Decorations for Living Room Tables - STAR D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TBKCYZ9mL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"LIGHT UP YOUR HOME WITH MIRROR IMBEDDED STAR, DAY AND NIGHT 1. 13\" Large five pointed star shape, decorated by 15 large white LED bulbs, falls from the sky and into your home, giving you a crystal feel by day.2. At night, 15 LED bulbs shine gently through the mirror imbedded star & give off a warm white glow, creating a display of adoration & affection.3. This innovative MIRROR IMBEDDED STAR sign looks better in reality than photos. VERSATILE DECORATIONS 1. The lifelike STAR light can be displayed as a signal or combined with other pieces to create an eclectic lighting installation.2. Place it on your table to create your own elaborate holiday scene; One keyhole slot at back for easy display on the wall. LET TIME BE YOUR CONVENIENCE 1. 6hr Timer: Once the light is switched on, the timer is triggered. The light will stay on for 6 hours and remain off for 18 hours, only to light up again for another 6 hours automatically.2. Suitable for both daily home decorations & festival decorations (Valentine's Day, Thanksgiving, and Birthday Parties) to increase festive ambience. ENERGY-SAVING & DURABLE 1. No power outlet needed & requires 2 AA batteries (included).2. 15 long lasting LED bulbs provide low energy consumption while enhancing your festival cheer & produce no heat after long-time use.3. Textured ABS exterior: sturdy, lightweight, corrosion-resistant & durable (not easy to break down). FAQs 1. It will always be in the OFF position when you receive your order, you will need to switch it to the ON position (at back) during installation.2. An ON/OFF switch is at back for manual control. ATTENTION 1. Store the light in a cool & dry place and remove batteries if product is not to be used for a long time.2. A short-circuit may cause severe damage to the batteries. Do not drop, hit or otherwise abuse the batteries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TBKCYZ9mL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bright Zeal","source_asin":"B072FJ247Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-893217","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072FJ247Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072FJ247Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
