window.products.push({"id":893346,"name":"UDD Clear Shower Caddy with Soap Dish, Bathroom Shower Organizer Storage Shower Rack Wall Adhesive Shower Shelves for Dorm Bathtub, 3 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r1Yc6+AxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Transparent Shower Caddy】- The entire shower caddy is made of premium clear plastic. It is strong and durable enough to provide long-term storage solution for your shower room. The clear shower caddy makes items visible at a glance, so you can easily reach the items you need. They are clear/transparent shower organizers that make your shower feel roomier. 【High Strength Adhesives】- The strong adhesive provides excellent support for the shower basket and soap dish to ensure quality and longevity. The traceless and invisible features do a good job of maintaining the clear appearance of the shower organizer set. Workable for smooth and solid walls, do not stick it to wallpaper, rough or uneven walls. 【2 Shower Baskets with Soap Dish】- Two deep shower baskets can easily keep most of your toiletries in order, such as: shower gel, shampoo, toothpaste, etc. The separate clear soap dish can hold your soap, sponge or loofah nicely. 3-Pack wall mounted shower organizer creates extra storage space for your shower room. It's an ideal shower caddy for inside shower room with tub, small space, apartment, dorm. 【Details of the Design】The shower basket and soap dish are designed with holes at the bottom to help drain quickly. Both the shower basket and soap dish have two wall pads on the back that do a great job of keeping the clear shower shelf and your walls away from scratches while making the shower shelf more stable. The bottom of the soap dish has raised stripes that allow the soap to rise from the bottom of the dish to assist in complete drainage. 【Versatile Storage Rack/Shelf】Works well as a sink shelf, kitchen shelf, bathroom shelf or washroom shelf. Easy to install it on your wall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r1Yc6+AxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UDD","source_asin":"B0C23551D7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-893346","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C23551D7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C23551D7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
