window.products.push({"id":893597,"name":"GeoSpecimens Wholesale Rose Quartz 0.5 LB Pink Quartz Crystal Mineral Specimens, Natural Rose Quartz Tumbling, Cutting, Bead, Facet Rough from Brazil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5158bCYcO+L._AC_.jpg","description":"WHOLESALE Lot ROSE QUARTZ Crystal Rough Natural Pink Quartz Crystal Tumbling Facet Rough Wire Wrap Bead Brazil by GeoSpecimens. Quantity: 6-10 Stones. Size: 1-2\" Each Locality: Minas Gerais, Brazil This sale is for 6-10 medium Rose Quartz rough crystal stones similar to the stock photos pictured. These lots contain 4 large stones - each weighing approximately 2-4+ ounces and contain the highest quality undrilled pink crystal specimens suitable for faceting, tumbling, beads, display or ???. ROSE QUARTZ PROPERTIES: Rose quartz is a type of quartz that exhibits a pale pink to rose red hue. The color is usually considered as due to trace amounts of titanium, iron, or manganese in the massive material. Some types of quartz contain microscopic rutile needles that produce an asterism in transmitted light. Recent X-ray diffraction studies suggest that the color is due to thin microscopic fibers of possibly dumortierite within the massive quartz. In crystal form (rarely found) it is called pink quartz and its color is thought to be caused by trace amounts of phosphate or aluminium. The color in crystals is apparently photosensitive and subject to fading. The first crystals were found in a pegmatite found near Rumford, Maine, US, but most crystals on the market come from Minas Gerais, Brazil. Courtesy of Wikipedia ** FREE REPLACEMENT GUARANTEE If you are unhappy with the specimen you receive we will send a free replacement at no charge. Please contact us for more information.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5158bCYcO+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pachamama Essentials","source_asin":"B00MQ899U6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-893597","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MQ899U6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MQ899U6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
