window.products.push({"id":893642,"name":"Joho Baking Popsicle Molds Ice Pop Molds, Large Ice Cream Bar Mold, Silicone Cakesicle Mold for DIY Ice Cream, Oval, Set of 2, 4-Cavity","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k7ks7HDyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FOOD GRADE SILICONE POPSICLE MOLD SET: Joho Baking Popsicle molds are made of premium food grade silicone,BPA free,odorless.Silicone popsicle molds are in classic oval shape,nonstick and flexible,easy to release and clean up,hand wash and dishwasher safe. FUN TO CREATE HEALTHY POPSICLES: Cake popsicle molds are great for all kinds of popsicle desserts and homemade cakesicles.Easy to create unique frozen treats,just add ice creams,yogurt,purees,fruits,pudding,chocolate or jam into homemade popsicle molds,after frozen,you will get your own unique ice popsicles.Lare Ice cream molds size: 10.16x5.74x1.02in. EASY TO USE:Silicone popsicle mold set comes with 2pcs 4-cavity large popsicle mold and 100pcs wooden sticks.You can make 8 popsicles at a time in more tastes.The cakesicle molds silicone are easy to use,as flat design,ice lolly can be decorated easily with candy,nut or fruit. VERSATILE ICE POPSICLE MOLDS: Our cake popsicle molds are not only for summer,but also in winter.Silicone ice cream molds can safe use in oven,microwave and freezer.Wide temparature range: -76℉ to 446℉.And ice cream bar molds can stackable,so store easily and save space in freezer. LIFETIME GUARANTEED FOR SILICONE MOLDS POPSICLE: Enjoy a lifetime of healthy ice creams with our ice cream popsicle molds.Great DIY gift to your kids or friends.If you're dissatisfied with our ice cream molds,it's ok for a replacement or refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k7ks7HDyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOHO BAKING","source_asin":"B08523DG98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-893642","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08523DG98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08523DG98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":893643,"name":"ARTISHION Indoor Area Rugs Living Room Carpets, Super Soft Fluffy Modern Rugs, Shaggy Plush Non-Slip for Bedroom Home Nursery Girls Boys Holiday Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mSZN2k64L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"【SUPER SOFT & FLUFFY】- Our area rug is designed for luxurious feeling and comfort. Features a top layer of thick, shaggy material that is 1.6in high, also resistant to fading and no shedding. Soft and fluffy to touch, adding warm and softness to your home. 【LARGE SIZE & MODERN DESIGN】- Our super soft shaggy area rug is 5 x 8 feet, large enough to cover your living room and provide excellent touch feeling. The modern design will add a peaceful atmosphere to your home. Also ideal for decorating your bedroom, nursery, children’s room, baby’s room, dining room and etc. 【ANTI-SLIP BOTTOM】- This fluffy rug is designed with non-slip dots on the back, which can help to hold in place on the floor, giving the carpet a certain anti-slip function. You can play with your kids on the carpet without worry and have fun. 【EASY TO CLEAN】- Simply clean the floor carpet with a hand-held vacuum. You can also wipe clean the dirty parts with cold water or wash it with hands. Allow your shag rug to fully air dry before next use. Please DO NOT wash it by machine. 【PERFECT GIFT】- This area rug is a perfect gift for your family and friends. It will provide them with softness and warm, also can be a wonderful decoration for your room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mSZN2k64L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARTISHION","source_asin":"B08D617GZH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-893643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D617GZH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D617GZH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":893644,"name":"Airtight Canister Set Stainless Steel,4 Piece Food Storage Container with Lids for Tea,Coffee,Snacks, Milk Powder,Sugar,Flour Canisters with Clear Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j8HSkljoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Quality】- Canisters for kitchen are made of high quality stainless steel,which is safe for everyday use.The BPA free silicone gasket have no smelly odour,and no toxic chemical releasing in the process of using.Hand-washing Recommended. 【Airtight Latching Lid】- Many foods,spices and condiments are negatively affected by exposure to air,humidity,light and heat.Our hinged,clamp-top lids with silicone rubber gasket help to protect the contents and ensure they remain fresh for a long time. 【4 Different Size Storage Containers】-This kitchen organization set includes 4 air-tight containers with different size(4”*2.95”/4”*4.13”/4”*4.92”/4”*6.69”).Great for storing everything from flour,beans,crackers,snacks, pasta, coffee, milk powder, sugar to smaller servings of cereal. 【Keep Your Food Fresh】- Keep your food fresh with our very easy to use airtight lid-lock mechanism.No dealing with flimsy pumps.Our canisters sets are created an airtight seal by simply pushing down the ring on the lid.Lift the ring and push up whenever you want to open the containers. 【No Risk Purchased】- We offer not only Top Grade Quality Products but also provide Friendly Customer Service along with our 3-Month no questions asked warranty policy.Click ‘Add to Cart’ now to keep your pantry organized,your food fresh,and your kitchen looking oh so elegant!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j8HSkljoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Houzemann","source_asin":"B07NZSYYP2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-893644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NZSYYP2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NZSYYP2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
