window.products.push({"id":893717,"name":"Electric Can Opener Electric Smooth Edge Automatic Can Opener Smooth Edge for Seniors One-Touch Switch Electric Can Opener Electric Red Electric Can O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l3PFMDU+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How to use: 1. Put the can on a flat surface and then put the electric can opener on the can. (The edge of the can must be in the groove of the iron sheet and the blade) 2. Press and hold the button once and release it, the can opener will automatically cut the side of the can. 3. After the cutting is completed,it will stop working automatically. 4. Make sure that the motor stops after the cutter returns to the original position. Then remove the electric can opener from the can. Tips: 1. The iron piece of the electric can opener must be pressed by the can before the button will work. 2. If the battery is exhausted, pressing the button may not release the jar, then you must replace AA batteries. 3. If the can is stuck, press again the  button  of the  can openers electric. Rotate it in the opposite direction to release the can. 4. Jars with heavy seams and uneven edges may block the can opener. If this happens, follow the steps above to release the can. Specification: Size: 4.7*2.7*2.4 inches Color: Red Package contains: 1* Electric can opener(Battery is not included) 1*Product instruction manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l3PFMDU+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RAKIGI","source_asin":"B0BBVR77B9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-893717","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBVR77B9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBVR77B9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":893718,"name":"Totally Bamboo Scoops, Set of 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.66,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31hxOgCUqSL._AC_.jpg","description":"Totally Bamboo's set of 3 scoops were created with the Epicurean kitchen in mind. Ideal for scooping rice, flour, tea, coffee¿anything in the kitchen. Fits nicely in the hand. Hand wash. No stains or paint are used to create the set of 3 scoop's scrumptious Honey shade. This color is created in a very specialized heating process which caramelizes the natural sugar in the wood; it is permanent and will not fade or wash out. Care: wash with warm water and mild detergent and occasionally wipe with mineral oil (Do not clean in the dishwasher). An Ecological wonder, Bamboo is a grass that grows to a harvestable height of 60 feet in 3 to 5 years. It has an extensive root system that continually develops new shoots thus not requiring replanting making it an incredible self-renewing resource and a brilliant alternative to the wide spread clear cutting of our world's hard wood forests. Do the world a favor¿ Do Bamboo.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31hxOgCUqSL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Totally Bamboo","source_asin":"B000O5EUES","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-893718","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000O5EUES","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000O5EUES","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":893719,"name":"ODesign Shower Caddy Shelf Over Door with 4 Hooks Rustproof Bathroom Kitchen Storage Basket with Suctions for Large Shampoo Conditioner - 3 Tiers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.71,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VWvgUs6LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Overall Size: 74 x 29cm (29.13 x 11.41inches). 1.96 width can be adjusted according to the door. Adjustable Height: Free to adjust the distance between each shelves. It can hold several large bottles of shampoo, lotion, etc. Each caddy weighs 20 pounds. Four Hooks for Hanging Items: These hooks on the shower shelf can hold wash clothes, loofahs and shavers. All of the hooks are great for various bathing accessories. Premium Quality，Classy Living: ODesign aims at more exquisite products, more accurate services and better quality of life. Any question, feel free to contact us,we will solve your problem in 24h!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VWvgUs6LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ODesign","source_asin":"B0BNKWLHY4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-893719","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNKWLHY4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNKWLHY4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":893720,"name":"Vacu Vin Wine Saver Pump with Vacuum Wine Stopper - Set of 4, Black for Wine Savers - Keep Your Wine Fresh for up to 10 Days - 1 Pump 4 Stoppers - Reu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6178aJ-s6nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Vacu Vin Inc 987460 Wine Saver Concerto with 4 Stoppers Standard Black Amazon.com The Vacu Vin Concerto Pump with 4 x Vacuum Bottle Stoppers - Black The idea for the Vacu Vin Wine Saver emanated directly from the taste of spoiled wine - something that its inventors wanted to prevent once a bottle had been opened. The device was the first of its kind within the international market and has revolutionised the wine preservation process. It is now used in over 35 million households and more than 80 countries throughout the world.  The Wine Saver is a vacuum pump that extracts the air from an opened wine bottle and re-seals it using a rubber stopper. The airtight vacuum inhibits the oxidation process that is responsible for the deterioration of wine. The vacuum is created by placing a stopper into the neck of the opened bottle and pumping it until resistance is detectable. The pump incorporates a patented 'click' mechanism that indicates when a sufficient airtight environment has been established.  The Vacu Vin Wine Saver is suitable for all but sparkling wines. It is highly durable and easy to clean via wiping with warm water and conventional detergents (if necessary). The Vacuum Stoppers are dishwasher safe. The Vacu Vin Wine Saver Family The Wine Saver is also available in the following formats:  1) A traditionally-shaped pump that is accompanied by 2 x Vacuum Bottle Stoppers (in either black or white).  2) A black or white pump that is packaged alongside 1 x Vacuum Bottle Stopper.  3) A stainless steel pump that contains 2 x Vacuum Bottle Stoppers and 2 x Wine Servers/Pourers.  4) A larger white pump that has an enhanced vacuum-creation capacity.  In addition, it can also be purchased as part of the Vacu Vin Wine Set, the Wine Saver Gift Set (White or Black) and the Wine Essentials Gift Set (White or Black). About Vacu Vin Vacu Vin was originally established in 1986 in order to manufacture and distribute the iconic Vacuum Wine Saver. Since then the family-owned company has evolved into a leading brand within the housewares industry, offering an array of barware accessories and kitchen gadgets that are characterised by their quality and innovative functionality. In addition to the Vacuum Wine Saver, Vacu Vin’s product portfolio also includes the award-winning Rapid Ice Coolers and Pineapple Slicers, all of which are now used in over 35 million households and more than 80 countries throughout the world. A specialist in-house design team are constantly striving to add new items to the company’s ever-evolving assortment in order to satisfy the demands of the modern-day consumer. Social Involvement and Fundraising Social involvement has always been at the forefront of Vacu Vin’s philosophy. The company employs over 150 mentally and physically disadvantaged people at their head office production facility in order to assist in the assembly and packaging of almost every product. Vacu Vin also funds the ‘Sharing Success Foundation’, which has helped over 50,000 disabled children and contributed significantly to the development of new facilities in numerous countries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6178aJ-s6nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vacu Vin","source_asin":"B0C6B7SF5D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-893720","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6B7SF5D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6B7SF5D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
