window.products.push({"id":893818,"name":"LORRAINE HOME FASHIONS Priscilla Shower Curtain, 70-Inch by 72-Inch, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tF8EvdC6L._AC_.jpg","description":"Elegant yet fun Casual Couture uses layers of delicate gently ruffled knitted lace to create an elaborate bouffant styled shower curtain. Available in White or Ivory Machine wash, warm water, gentle cycle. Do not bleach. Line dry. Touch up with warm iron if necessary. Measures 70\" wide x 72\" long. We recommend using a fabric shower liner. Coordinates with our other Priscilla lace window treatments to match your bathroom window.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tF8EvdC6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LORRAINE HOME FASHIONS","source_asin":"B00BV8IEV2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-893818","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BV8IEV2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BV8IEV2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":893819,"name":"Smith Mountain Lake Virginia Map Rustic Metal Art Print from Illustration by Lakebound 11.5\" x 17.5\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D0uAWgYWL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This work of art is by the artists at Lakebound. Many people have strong and lasting memories of fun holidays and vacations at the lake or on the coast. Summers learning to water ski, swim, sleep-away camp, cliff jumping, time at the cabin, the smell of shady coves and bays, the lazy days melting into warm evenings, and fall after the crowds leave. There is something about the being on the water that is like nowhere else. Lakebound classic vintage maps are geographically accurate and bring a little lake or coastal magic to you and the walls of your home or office. This rustic metal art print poster is wall décor ready to hang. It is from an original work of art created by an award-winning independent artist. All metal wall art decor prints are professionally printed in the USA on the highest quality heavy-gauge aluminum with premium, long-lasting art inks that generate intense, rich colors that are true to the artist’s vision and original creation. The time and care put into producing your metal art print poster makes it a tremendous addition to your kitchen, bedroom, family room, office, or even dorm room wall décor. We are committed to providing preeminent and distinctive American and Canadian wall art décor for your home. Discover exclusive, American and Canadian-made and designed wall art of beautiful and popular destinations throughout the world from Art of Place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D0uAWgYWL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Art of Place","source_asin":"B07Q5CWRQC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-893819","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q5CWRQC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q5CWRQC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":893820,"name":"Indian Fish Print Block Print Kantha Quilt Throw Blanket Kantha Bedspread Pure Cotton Sofa Cover Handmade Kantha Twin 90x60 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D-zYOQ0KL._AC_SL1140_.jpg","description":"This Is Completely Hand Quilted Blanket Made From Cotton. A Feast For The Eyes From South Asia, This Delightful Piece Will Add Some Exotic Flair To Your Living Space. Even You Can Gift It To Your Relative And Any Family Member As Well. This A Example Of A Great Craftsmanship For Centuries In India And Bangladesh, Bengali Women Stitched Together Old Saris And Cloth Scraps To Form Blankets And Cushions. “Kantha” Is The Sanskrit Word For Rags, And Old Cloth Was Believed To Provide Protection From Harm. Authentic Kantha Throws Are Handmade And Will Vary In Size, Color, And Pattern. Our Kantha Quilts Are Made With 2 Layers Of Sari Cloth. The Final Product Is Still Thin, Not Bulky, But Definitely As \"Hefty\" As Kantha Come. They Are Light, But Provide A Good Warmth, As Well. A Simple Vintage Patchwork Quilt Design Of Soft Kantha Quilts. Each Quilt Is Carefully Hand Stitched With Care And Precision With Thousands Of Tiny Kantha Stitches. The 2 Layers Of Soft Kantha Embroidered Cotton Are Soft And Lightweight.To Make The Kantha Cloth, The Fabric Is First Cut To Shape And Layered To Achieve The Desired Size And Thickness. The Layers Are Spread Out On The Ground And Ironed. The Artisan Will First Stitch Some Large, Loose Basting Stitches Around The Edge Of The Fabric To Hold The Layers Together.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D-zYOQ0KL._AC_SL1140_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09JYTHPXM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-893820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JYTHPXM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JYTHPXM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":893821,"name":"48 Pieces Graduation Confetti Centerpieces Diploma Confetti Grad Caps Confetti Black and Gold Graduation Table Decorations for 2022 School Graduations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913yxrCnJvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features:  Vivid design: We provide you with graduation party decorations, which are made into the shape of diploma and grad caps in black and gold. They will certainly make your graduation party become more lively and interesting.  Wide rang of use: These graduation centerpieces are accent in party decorations, party invitation, cupcake toppers, goody bags, favors, gift wrapping, scrapbook, card making. And it can also be applied as photo props, which can create atmosphere and interesting.  Specifications: Color: as shown in the pictures Material: paper  Note: Manual measurement, please allow slight errors on size. The colors may exist slight difference due to different screens.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913yxrCnJvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zonon","source_asin":"B09W2RLRB6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-893821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W2RLRB6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W2RLRB6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":893822,"name":"Tom Douglas by Pinzon Epicurean 14-by-17-Inch Silicone-Tipped Cutting Board","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Vby1JDuxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer Award-winning chef-restaurateur Tom Douglas, Epicurean, and Amazon.com introduce a line of multi-functional cutting boards that will inspire home chefs and build confidence in the kitchen. This 14-by-17-inch cutting board is constructed of a natural compressed wood-fiber laminate made from sustainable harvested trees. The multi-functional surface won't dull knives; is heat-resistant to 350 degrees F, which means hot pans can be placed on it without leaving a brown ring; requires no oiling; and is dishwasher-safe and approved by the National Safety Foundation (NSF). Both the top and bottom surfaces may be used for cutting meat, chopping onions, slicing bread, and more--the natural finish will darken with use. Rounded silicone edges prevent the board from slipping. This versatile board features the Tom Douglas logo and doubles as an attractive serving tray for cheeses, appetizers, and pizza. This item is manufactured in the USA. Tom's Tips This board is great for presenting and serving foods such as pizzas and tortes. It's both attractive and functional. This board is great for presenting and serving foods such as pizzas and tortes. It's both attractive and functional. It never slips when you’re cutting meat, veggies, and fish. It never slips when you’re cutting meat, veggies, and fish. About Tom Douglas Tom Douglas is an American chef, restaurateur, and writer. He is well known for helping to define Northwest cuisine and igniting the Seattle restaurant scene, winning the James Beard Award for Best Northwest Chef in 1994. Since 1989, Tom has opened five of Seattle’s most popular restaurants: Dahlia Lounge; the Greek-inspired Lola; Serious Pie pizzeria; Palace Kitchen; and Pike Place Market’s iconic seafood restaurant, Etta’s. He also owns Dahlia Bakery, famous for its Triple Coconut Cream Pie. Tom is the author of Tom Douglas' Seattle Kitchen , named Best American Cookbook by the James Beard Foundation, Tom's Big Dinners , and I Love Crab Cakes! He bested Masaharu Morimoto in an episode of Iron Chef America and was named 2008 Bon Appétit Restaurateur of the Year. Tom is currently working with Amazon.com on an exclusive line of kitchen and dining products, aimed at building confidence in the kitchen. Visit the Tom Douglas by Pinzon Store to browse his full line of Tom Douglas by Pinzon products, discover Tom's all-time favorite cookbooks, and find delicious recipes to make with his kitchen products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Vby1JDuxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tom Douglas","source_asin":"B001VNC5RG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-893822","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001VNC5RG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001VNC5RG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
