window.products.push({"id":893989,"name":"Verefa Robot Vacuum Self-Empty, Empties Itself for 70 Days, Lidar Navigation Robot Vacuum Cleaner 2700Pa, Smart Mapping Robotic Vacuum 210mins Runtime","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":369.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wQmO3uMrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【70 Days of Hands-Free Cleaning】The self-empty robot vacuum cleaner has a full auto-empty charging base, with auto-empty charging. 4L large-capacity dust bag can hold dirt and debris for up to 70 days at one time, easy to be operated. The dust bag needs to be replaced only once every 10 weeks. A large dust box is equipped with a capacity of 550ML to reduce the frequency of cleaning garbage. It is specially designed for you in busy life or those who are not good at machinery. 【Precise LIDAR Navigation & ZigZag Cleaning】The intelligent LIDAR of the robotic vacuum cleaner ensures full cleaning coverage, accurately maps the home, effectively detects and avoids objects in its path, and provides efficient path planning for multi-room cleaning. Z-shaped zigzag cleaning can avoid missing cleaning and greatly improve cleaning efficiency with its high cleaning coverage. You can also set up No-Go zone, so you only can clean wherever you want. 【Excellent Deep Cleaning Ability】The self-emptying robot vacuum cleaner has a strong vacuum power of 2700Pa, which can easily suck up pet hair, dirt, and dust from the floor. 4-level power adjustment meets various cleaning needs. The integrated roller brush system brings the brush closer to the ground and the crevices can also be cleaned. Auto-boost technology automatically adjusts the vacuum power when cleaning the carpet. Very suitable for hard floors, tiles, marble, carpets, and other floors. 【Large-capacity Battery & 210mins Runtime】The 5000mAh battery of the lidar robot vacuum can provide up to 210minutes of continuous cleaning and can clean an area of 2152 sqft with one charge. When the robot vacuum cleaner is running out of power, it will automatically return to the charging base for charging and will return to the place where it just stopped to continue cleaning, thus realizing full-coverage auto cleaning efficiently. 【2.4GHz Wi-Fi Connection & App & Voice Control】With the \"Verefa Life\" APP, the cleaning control of the robotic vacuum is in your hands. You can view the cleaning route map in real-time, make a 7-day schedule cleaning, adjust the vacuum power, personalize the settings and reminders, etc. In addition, the robot vacuum cleaner works with Alexa and Google Assistant, which allows the robot vacuum cleaner to start, stop, and recharge automatically and other voice operations simply through your voice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wQmO3uMrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Verefa","source_asin":"B0BG2D7L48","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-893989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG2D7L48","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG2D7L48","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
